                        </layout>
                     </layoutDesc>
                  </objectDesc>
                  <handDesc>
                     <summary/>
                     <handNote>
                        <p>Nastaʻlīq with elements of shikastah</p>
                     </handNote>
                  </handDesc>
                  <additions>
                     <p>A form on f. 1r is dated 1 Ḥūt [13]01/22 February 1922. </p>
                     <p>A brief note on f. 100r records that the volume arrived and was taken for
                        scrutiny, in 1304/1925: <hi rend="italic">dar ṣafḥah 21 kitāb rasīd ast 1304
                           rasīd giriftah shudah</hi>. This is an allusion to another note, on ‘p.
                        21’ (f. 11r), which records that the volume was handed on 25 Sawr/16 May and
                        details recorded at the Finance Ministry’; the purpose of the note on f.
                        100r may therefore have been to specify the year – not mentioned on f. 11r –
                        without committing the offence of altering the text. </p>
                  </additions>
